/T (The survey also explored awareness of non-traditional financial or digital activities that may involve elements similar to gambling. Figure 5 displays these results. Awareness of these gambling-like financial products varies considerably across categories. Cryptocurrencies are the most widely recognized, with 53% of respondents reporting being very or somewhat aware, followed by NFTs \(31%\). Awareness of other financial products with gambling-like elements is substantially lower. )
/E (The survey also explored awareness of non-traditional financial or digital activities that may involve elements similar to gambling. Figure 5 displays these results. Awareness of these gambling-like financial products varies considerably across categories. Cryptocurrencies are the most widely recognized, with 53% of respondents reporting being very or somewhat aware, followed by NFTs \(31%\). Awareness of other financial products with gambling-like elements is substantially lower. )
