/T (Arizona currently offers two primary self-exclusion programs. Casino self-exclusion allows individuals to voluntarily exclude themselves from all casinos operating within the state. Event Wagering and Fantasy Sports \(EWFS\) self-exclusion allows individuals to prohibit themselves from placing wagers or entering fantasy sports contests at licensed retail locations and Arizona-regulated online or mobile platforms. Individuals enrolled in either program are prohibited from collecting winnings or recovering losses incurred while gambling during the exclusion period. Restrictions also extend to non-gambling amenities offered by gambling facilities, including hotels, restaurants, )
