/E (Awareness of both casino and sportsbook VSE programs was higher among males than females, with rates approximately 1.5 times greater. Awareness was also highest among respondents who engaged in more frequent or higher-risk gambling activities. Participants reporting live Keno wagering had the highest awareness of casino VSE programs \(59%\), followed by those participating in prediction markets \(48%\) and eSports wagering \(41%\). Awareness of sportsbook VSE programs followed a similar pattern.)
