/T (The findings from this survey suggest several important implications for the continued development of problem gambling prevention, treatment, responsible gambling, and public health initiatives in Arizona. Although most Arizonans gamble without experiencing serious adverse consequences, a substantial proportion of the adult population reported gambling-related problems and several findings point to opportunities for strengthening statewide responses to gambling-related harms.)
