/Title (The survey also identified strong relationships between gambling-related harm and broader behavioral health concerns, including mental health conditions, substance use, and other potentially problematic behaviors such as gaming and excessive internet use. These findings reinforce the importance of viewing gambling-related harm within a broader public health and behavioral health framework rather than as an isolated issue.)
/Dest [52 0 R /Fit]
