/Title (Similar to findings from the FY2022-23 study,1 approximately one in five Arizona adults experienced some level of gambling-related harm, with an estimated 4% likely meeting diagnostic criteria for a gambling disorder. Elevated risk was concentrated among younger adults and individuals who gamble more frequently, engage in sports betting, and participate in multiple forms of gambling, particularly online and app-based activities.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1988 0 R
/Prev 4414 0 R
/Next 4692 0 R
>>
