/Title (In FY2025-26, 22% of Arizonans reported engaging in legal sports betting using online or app-based platforms, compared to 16% who reported betting at physical locations. This indicates a preference for online and mobile wagering relative to in-person betting. Males were more than twice as likely as females to use online or app-based platforms, consistent with their higher overall participation in sports betting. Similarly, males were nearly three times as likely as females to place sports wagers at physical locations.)
