/Parent 5316 0 R
/Next 5346 0 R
>>
endobj
5346 0 obj
<<
/Title (These findings indicate that gambling-related problems frequently co-occur with other potentially problematic behaviors, particularly those that are often digitally mediated, such as video gaming and mobile phone use. The high overlap suggests that gambling-related harm may not occur in isolation, but rather as part of a broader pattern of difficulty regulating behavior.)
/Dest [37 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5316 0 R
/Prev 5345 0 R
>>
endobj
